# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
# trigger_tool: 出错的工具 (configure/cmake/meson/make/gcc/clang/ld/python/pip/install/test/runtime)
# phase:         出错阶段 (configuration/compilation/linking/installation/testing/runtime)
# error_signature: 正则表达式(|分隔), 用于精确匹配日志文本
id:                     E3420
trigger_tool: perl|IO::Pty|IO::Tty
phase: build|test|runtime
error_signature: IO::Handle::new_from_fd|Bad file descriptor|fd.s don.t clash with stdin

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
# severity:      3=🔴blocking  2=🟡medium  1=🟢minor  0=✅resolved
# category:      分类标签（受控词表 64 词，逗号分隔，最多 5 个；add/promote 自动归一化）
# prescan_pattern: （可选）预编译源码扫描正则——写入后 PreScanner 运行时自动派生
#                   PSCAN-KB-{id} 规则，无需改 pre-scan-rules.yaml（知识增长即扫描能力增长）
# prescan_globs:   （可选）扫描范围 glob 列表，默认 '*.c, *.h, *.cc, *.cpp, *.sh, Makefile*, *.mk'
# 词表: platform, compat, limitation, detection, hmdfs, ohos, selinux, kernel, portability, libc, musl, posix, syscall, headers, threading, socket, network, build-system, cmake, autotools ...（全表见 scripts/ohc/kb_taxonomy.py）
# match_keywords: 纯文本关键词(逗号分隔), 用于粗筛(固定字符串匹配F)
# title:         简短标题(一句话描述错误模式)
severity:               2
category:               perl, runtime, descriptor-ownership, pty
match_keywords: PerlIO_importFILE, F_DUPFD, fdopen, IO::Pty, IO::Tty, EACCES, standard descriptors, FD_CLOEXEC, new_from_fd
title: 真实PTY的PerlIO导入要在旧转换前移交所有权并保留标准描述符

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
# root_cause:       一句话根因描述(逗号可分行)
# affected_scope:   影响范围
# verification_cmd: 验证诊断是否正确的命令
root_cause: Observed valid OHOS PTY master rejects fstat and legacy Perl descriptor conversion; a naive dup can reuse closed standard descriptors, causing original fd allocation assertions to fail.
affected_scope: Perl XS descriptor adoption on the observed OHOS application domain when fstat=EACCES, isatty and F_GETFD succeed.
verification_cmd: Actual devnull/master/slave controls; original9 programs64 inventory62 applicable2 accepted guards, installed C3 and independent Harmony signature-loader control, two formal creates.

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
# 推荐方案 (priority 越小越优先, 从 1 开始)
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: real-perlio-import-before-legacy-conversion-with-f-dupfd-three
rec_description: HarmonyOS真实PTY主端fstat返回EACCES且fd仍有效时，Perl旧new_from_fd可能失败并消费描述符；应在旧转换前，用受限OHOS分支复制真实主端为F_DUPFD>=3，fdopen实际FILE流后PerlIO_importFILE导入，成功移交所有权再关闭原fd一次。F_DUPFD下界保留上游有意关闭的0/1/2，避免dup复用标准描述符破坏原测试。保持实际终端、原始字节与termios行为，不合成stat结果。
rec_command: fcntl(fd,F_DUPFD,3); fdopen(copy,"r+"); PerlIO_importFILE(file,"r+"); transfer ownership; close(original) once
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: Narrow __OHOS__ runtime-validated branch, actual PTY FILE stream and PerlIO adoption; retain upstream fallback and test bytes.

# 回退方案 (当推荐方案不可用时尝试)
